            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc 3 Mien",
            "review_text": "Enaj\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat vegetarian food!\nNov 2019\nSometimes can be tricky to get authentic Vietnamese vegetarian food in Hanoi but this place hit the spot. They’ve got a bunch of vegetable dishes on their menu, and what we ordered was absolutely delicious...especially the stir fried greens which were so simple but so so good. Mmm.\nWritten November 28, 2019",
