            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc 3 Mien",
            "review_text": "Susan\n5 contributions\n0\nSimple, fresh vegetables - unexpectedly good!\nNov 2019 • Family\nThere are a lot of touristy places in this part of the old quarter and when we decided to go in here we really weren’t expecting much. There is a tacky menu with photos but there is a little vegetarian section on it. We chose stir fried greens, sesame tofu and vegetable fresh rice rolls. The food was simple, fresh and good and suddenly seemed like heaven. We would definitely go back for a simple meal. 230k for the two of us including one beer.\nRead more\nWritten November 28, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
