            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc 3 Mien",
            "review_text": "Daniel G\nSaint-Malo, France148 contributions\n0\nTourist trap\nJul 2019 • Business\nApart from the numerous guys that try to push you physically to get in (warning fake client before the fake fries who put his fist in my spine to push me in, next time - even if I’m with a group - I will show you how to behave), only a stupid tourist will fail to see that 2 guys sit all evening before a dish that comprises cold French fries, just to make you believe it’s a successful restaurant. Paying all those pushers has a price and YOU pay it. The food is terrible and service so slow that in the group I was with 3 had finished and 2 still had not been served. Stay away from that place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2019",
